bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_nowrap_lead_space_after_space_not_collapsed_2026-11-27, 0, "2026-11-27 w5-5: fix implemented across layout_foundation.spl (nowrap_collapsed_lead_* tables, save/restore helpers, and inline_item_width_err_milli width adjustment) and layout_engine.spl (web_html_layout_tree and layout_selected save/restore, inline enter/exit after_space/at_line_start propagation, and leading collapsible space collapse on white-space:nowrap/whitespace-only runs keeping out_bw at painted width so Draw IR / Engine2D band clip does not cull text at x=0 while advancing inline_x and parent out_bw by post_collapse_bw); added AC-24 in inline_line_end_space_align_chrome159_spec.spl and Bug 3 (including x=0 Draw IR and Engine2D/sw parity) in layout_engine_w5_5_chrome159_fixes_spec.spl. Windows host interpreter: layout_engine_w5_5_chrome159_fixes_spec 5/5 passed; inline_line_end_space_align_chrome159_spec 9/24 passed (15 Linux TTF metric assertions including AC-24 fail without Linux TTF assets). waiting-for: Linux Chrome 159 TTF verification"

